{
  "conversation_lines": [
    {
      "turn_number": 1,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:25:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Hi, I'm Dr. Lee. I’ll be your doctor during this stay. You were just admitted after coming in from the ER. Can you tell me what’s been going on?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 2,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:27:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Hi… yeah. I got discharged yesterday, but then I vomited six liters of dark green fluid in just 12 hours. I was scared. I didn’t know what else to do."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 3,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:29:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That sounds terrifying. I’m glad you came back. We’re going to take good care of you. You’ve been dealing with gastroparesis and stomach drainage issues for a while, right?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 4,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:31:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes. My G-tube has never worked right since they changed it. I feel full all the time, nauseous, and nothing drains like it used to."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 5,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:33:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I see. In the ER, they gave you fluids and some medications for nausea and pain. Your blood pressure dipped a bit, but it’s stabilizing now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 6,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:35:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m still nauseous. And I didn’t vomit in the ER, but I feel like I could any minute."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 7,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:37:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll keep you on IV anti-nausea meds for now. We’re also going to check if your G-tube is working properly. There’s a plan to possibly replace it again if needed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 8,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:39:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Again? I’ve had so many changes. The last one didn’t help much."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 9,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:41:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I know it’s frustrating. But we’re thinking of switching to a Wills-Ogelsby tube. It’s designed to vent the stomach better and might help with the nausea and bloating."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 10,
      "time": "2185-05-13 16:43:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay… I’ll try anything at this point."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 11,
      "time": "2185-05-14 09:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. We started your TPN last night after getting approval. It should help with nutrition since you can’t eat."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 12,
      "time": "2185-05-14 09:17:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s great. I’ve been so weak. Did the insurance finally come through?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 13,
      "time": "2185-05-14 09:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Yes, they approved it through the end of the month. We’re also watching your labs. Your hematocrit dropped a bit, but it’s stable now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 14,
      "time": "2185-05-14 09:21:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ve been losing weight for months. I’m worried I’ll never gain it back."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 15,
      "time": "2185-05-14 09:23:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re addressing the malnutrition with TPN and will monitor your intake. It’ll take time, but we’re on the right track."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 16,
      "time": "2185-05-15 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re scheduled to replace your G-tube today. The radiology team will do it with imaging guidance. They’ll switch it to the Wills-Ogelsby tube."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 17,
      "time": "2185-05-15 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will it hurt? I’m nervous about the procedure."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 18,
      "time": "2185-05-15 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’ll get mild sedation—fentanyl and Versed—so you’ll be relaxed. It’s a quick procedure, and they’ll monitor your vitals the whole time."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 19,
      "time": "2185-05-15 10:06:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, as long as I’m not fully awake."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 20,
      "time": "2185-05-15 13:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The tube was successfully replaced. It’s now a 12 French Wills-Ogelsby tube. They used contrast to confirm placement, and it looks good."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 21,
      "time": "2185-05-15 13:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Do you think it’ll help? I just want to stop feeling so full and nauseous."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 22,
      "time": "2185-05-15 13:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re hopeful. The new tube has better venting. We’ll monitor output and your symptoms over the next few days."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 23,
      "time": "2185-05-16 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your G-tube output has improved since yesterday. That’s a good sign. Less buildup in the stomach means less nausea."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 24,
      "time": "2185-05-16 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I do feel a little better. Still nauseous, but not as intense."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 25,
      "time": "2185-05-16 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re keeping you on Phenergan and Ativan for nausea. We tried dronabinol, but you said it made you too drowsy?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 26,
      "time": "2185-05-16 09:06:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes, I couldn’t stay awake. I’ve had that problem with other anti-nausea meds before."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 27,
      "time": "2185-05-16 09:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll stick with what’s working and avoid the ones that cause sedation. We’ll also keep monitoring for dehydration and electrolyte issues."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 28,
      "time": "2185-05-17 10:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your labs are stable. No signs of infection. We’re continuing TPN nightly and your G-tube is draining well."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 29,
      "time": "2185-05-17 10:17:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s good. But I’ve been feeling… really alone. My husband tries, but he doesn’t get it."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 30,
      "time": "2185-05-17 10:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I hear you. This is a lot to handle. Would you like to talk to someone from our mental health team?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 31,
      "time": "2185-05-17 10:21:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Maybe. I’ve had depression for years. It’s worse when I’m sick like this."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 32,
      "time": "2185-05-17 10:23:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We can get you support. You’re not alone in this. We’re here to help with both your physical and emotional health."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 33,
      "time": "2185-05-18 09:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The mental health team met with you yesterday. They noted dysthymia and some suicidal thoughts. We’re going to keep an eye on that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 34,
      "time": "2185-05-18 09:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I don’t want to hurt myself. I just feel trapped by my body. I can’t eat, I vomit, I’m stuck with tubes…"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 35,
      "time": "2185-05-18 09:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I understand. We’re working to improve your quality of life. The new tube and TPN are steps forward. We’ll keep adjusting as needed."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 36,
      "time": "2185-05-19 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We did an abdominal X-ray yesterday. It showed no bowel obstruction. The gas pattern is normal, which is reassuring."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 37,
      "time": "2185-05-19 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ve had obstructions before. I get scared when I stop passing gas."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 38,
      "time": "2185-05-19 11:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "This scan shows things are moving. Your G-tube is helping decompress the stomach, which reduces that risk."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 39,
      "time": "2185-05-20 09:45:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’ve gone two days without vomiting. Your nausea is milder. That’s progress."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 40,
      "time": "2185-05-20 09:47:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I still feel sick, but not as bad. I can rest more now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 41,
      "time": "2185-05-20 09:49:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re also managing your other conditions—asthma, thyroid, and mitral valve issues—all stable for now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 42,
      "time": "2185-05-21 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re planning for discharge in a few days. You’ll go home on nightly TPN through your femoral line."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 43,
      "time": "2185-05-21 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Will I have help at home? I’m worried about managing the TPN myself."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 44,
      "time": "2185-05-21 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Yes, a visiting nurse will come weekly to check your labs and line. You’ll also have follow-up with your care team."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 45,
      "time": "2185-05-22 09:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your chem-10 panel came back normal. No dehydration or electrolyte issues. That’s great."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 46,
      "time": "2185-05-22 09:17:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m glad. I was worried about my kidneys."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 47,
      "time": "2185-05-22 09:19:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Everything looks stable. We’re also watching your hepatitis C, but no signs of liver problems now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 48,
      "time": "2185-05-23 10:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re finalizing your discharge plan. You’ll take Phenergan and Ativan for breakthrough nausea."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 49,
      "time": "2185-05-23 10:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "No dronabinol?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 50,
      "time": "2185-05-23 10:34:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll hold off due to the drowsiness. If needed, we can try something else later."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 51,
      "time": "2185-05-24 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Another X-ray today shows continued improvement. No obstruction. Your stomach is decompressing well."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 52,
      "time": "2185-05-24 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s a relief. I’ve been scared of another blockage."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 53,
      "time": "2185-05-25 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re doing well. We’re planning discharge tomorrow if all stays stable."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 54,
      "time": "2185-05-25 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m nervous about going home. What if it happens again?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 55,
      "time": "2185-05-25 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll make sure you have support. Call your nurse or the PACT team if symptoms worsen. Don’t wait."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 56,
      "time": "2185-05-26 08:45:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Last night’s TPN went smoothly. Your vitals are stable. We’re on track for discharge today."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 57,
      "time": "2185-05-26 08:47:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m ready, but I’m still scared."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 58,
      "time": "2185-05-26 08:49:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "It’s okay to feel that way. You’ve been through a lot. We’ll make sure you’re not alone in this."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 59,
      "time": "2185-05-26 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "The discharge orders are in. You’ll go home with TPN supplies, meds, and a nurse visit scheduled."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 60,
      "time": "2185-05-26 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you. I appreciate everything."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 61,
      "time": "2185-05-26 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re welcome. Take care of yourself. We’re here if you need us."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 62,
      "time": "2185-05-27 08:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Just a final check before you leave. Any last questions?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 63,
      "time": "2185-05-27 08:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "No, I think I’m good. Just hoping this tube works long-term."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 64,
      "time": "2185-05-27 08:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re hopeful too. Keep up with your follow-ups, and call if anything changes."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 65,
      "time": "2185-05-27 08:06:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will. Thanks again."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 66,
      "time": "2185-05-27 08:08:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Take care. We’ll see you in clinic soon."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 67,
      "time": "2185-05-27 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Nurse will come by with your discharge paperwork and prescriptions."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 68,
      "time": "2185-05-27 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, I’ll wait for her."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 69,
      "time": "2185-05-27 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Just confirming—your husband is on his way to pick you up?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 70,
      "time": "2185-05-27 10:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes, he’ll be here in about 30 minutes."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 71,
      "time": "2185-05-27 10:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Perfect. We’ll have everything ready for you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 72,
      "time": "2185-05-27 11:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your visiting nurse will call you tomorrow to confirm her visit."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 73,
      "time": "2185-05-27 11:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That’s reassuring. I was worried about being on my own."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 74,
      "time": "2185-05-27 11:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re not alone. We’re all part of your team."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 75,
      "time": "2185-05-27 12:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Just a final reminder—keep an eye on your G-tube site for redness or drainage."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 76,
      "time": "2185-05-27 12:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will. And call if it leaks or gets painful?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 77,
      "time": "2185-05-27 12:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Exactly. Same for fever, vomiting, or increased pain."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 78,
      "time": "2185-05-27 12:06:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Got it. I’ll be careful."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 79,
      "time": "2185-05-27 13:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your husband just arrived. We’ll get you discharged shortly."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 80,
      "time": "2185-05-27 13:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you, Dr. Lee. I really appreciate your help."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 81,
      "time": "2185-05-27 13:04:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re welcome. Take care, and we’ll see you soon."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 82,
      "time": "2185-05-27 13:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Nurse will wheel you out now."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 83,
      "time": "2185-05-27 13:32:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay, I’m ready."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 84,
      "time": "2185-05-27 14:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Have a safe trip home. Call us with any concerns."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 85,
      "time": "2185-05-27 14:30:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will. Thank you again."
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "admission_start": "2185-05-13 16:25:00",
    "admission_end": "2185-05-27 14:31:00",
    "summary_paragraph": "A woman with a complex history of gastroparesis, sclerosing mesenteritis, and G-tube dependence was readmitted within 24 hours of discharge due to recurrent severe nausea and vomiting of 6 liters of dark green emesis. She reported feeling isolated and anxious about her care. During the 14-day admission, her G-tube was replaced with a Wills-Ogelsby tube, which improved gastric venting and reduced symptoms. TPN was restarted via a femoral line after insurance approval. Nausea was managed with Phenergan and Ativan, while dronabinol was discontinued due to sedation. Abdominal imaging showed no obstruction, and labs remained stable. The patient expressed emotional distress, and mental health support was provided for dysthymia and suicidal ideation. She was discharged home with a plan for nightly TPN, visiting nurse visits, and close follow-up.",
    "problems": [
      "Gastroparesis",
      "Sclerosing mesenteritis",
      "Malnutrition of moderate degree",
      "Suicidal ideation",
      "Chronic hepatitis C without mention of hepatic coma",
      "Personal history of venous thrombosis and embolism",
      "Mitral valve disorders",
      "Migraine with aura, without mention of intractable migraine without mention of status migrainosus",
      "Asthma, unspecified type, unspecified",
      "Dysthymic disorder",
      "Dehydration",
      "Disorder of bone and cartilage, unspecified",
      "Sicca syndrome",
      "Unspecified acquired hypothyroidism",
      "Gastrostomy complication, unspecified",
      "Surgical operation with formation of external stoma causing abnormal patient reaction, or later complication, without mention of misadventure at time of operation"
    ]
  }
}
